---
description: Use pstack and poteto-mode, and keep personal contact details out of the repo
alwaysApply: true
---

Use pstack and /poteto-mode for non-trivial work in this repo. Install pstack from https://github.com/cursor/plugins/tree/main/pstack. Do not copy the plugin into the repo.

Follow the poteto-mode playbook that matches the task.

Per-role models live in `~/.cursor/rules/pstack-models.mdc`, written by /setup-pstack. Use that skill's role labels. If the file is missing, use the pstack skill defaults. Do not invent role names.

Never commit Mike Morse's phone number, home address, or other personal contact details. `npm run privacy` enforces phone-number and street-address patterns. Do not add real contact details as examples or fixtures.

Mike merges every pull request. Do not merge. Do not enable auto-merge. Do not change branch protection. The only repository setting you may change is the GitHub Pages source, and only to GitHub Actions.

`site/index.html` is a placeholder. Do not write resume content unless the task asks for it. Keep asset URLs relative so the project site works at `https://mmorsecode.github.io/resume-site/`.
